	fi
fi
text Furukawa calls out to me.
text My mind can't follow what's happening.
text Hold on a second.
text It was Fujibayashi, not Kotomi, who almost got caught in a crash.
text Kyou started to panic, but it was just a false alarm because Fujibayashi was safe all along.
text Kotomi had been playing around with me a short time before, and...
text She said "Tomoya-kun, guess who?" and covered my eyes...
setvar strS[1000] = "BG015"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s6
