text By the time I realize it, it's already after school.
text The whole day is a blur.
text I went to the nurse's office during every break but was turned away after hearing she was still asleep.
text Then I returned to the blank existence that was class.
text Today was simply that, repeated over and over.
text I glare at the surface of the desk.
text Kotomi's tears and crying are stuck in my head, refusing to go away.
text Yet none of this feels real.
text Everything happened so suddenly, it feels like an absurd dream.
text I sense someone standing in front of my desk.
text I look up and see Fujibayashi.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGRY23"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
