text Um...
sound DUD.aac
text @[Ryou]
text Would you like to go see how Kotomi-chan is doing?
text Fujibayashi looks like she's about to cry.
text I realize that I'm not the only one worrying about her.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. I'll go with you.
text @[Tomoya]
text And one more thing, Fujibayashi.
sound DUE.aac
text @[Ryou]
text Yes?
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't worry too much about it. It's definitely not your fault.
