text It's no use going to the nurse's office. The club president just came back from there.
text Kyou looks annoyed.
text Next to her is Furukawa, slouched over and depressed.
text Why are both Fujibayashi and Furukawa feeling responsible for this?
text @[Tomoya]
text Where's Kotomi? Did she go to the hospital?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG32"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
