text I was told that she left early.
text @[Tomoya]
text By herself?! Is she okay?
sound DUI.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Um...
sound DUJ.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text All the nurse told me was that Kotomi-chan went home already.
sound DUK.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text She wouldn't tell me anything else because of privacy issues.
text @[Tomoya]
text Privacy? This isn't the time for that!
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
