	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text From the extent of the pain she was in, there's no way she could fall asleep in the nurse's office.
text If she had waited until after school, we could have walked back with her. I can't understand why she would have left early.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then let's go to the teacher's office...
text If the nurse won't say anything, we'll have to ask the Class A teacher.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKY17"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
