text @[Kyou]
text Kotomi went home because she said she wanted to.
text She spits the words out with disdain, as if she doesn't like the taste as they come out of her mouth.
sound DUN.aac
text @[Kyou]
text She told us to "wait for Ichinose-san to tell you herself."
text @[Tomoya]
text What the hell does that mean?
