text @[Kyou]
text Hey, aren't we...?
text Kyou opens her mouth.
sound DUQ.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Maybe we aren't really her friends...
text Her words stab at me like a knife.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I turn my back to Kyou and hope that she didn't see me flinch in pain.
text I stick my hands in my pockets and walk down the hallway in the opposite direction.
sound DUR.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Where are you going?
text @[Tomoya]
text Home.
sound DUS.aac
text @[Kyou]
text To Kotomi's house? Just leave her alone for today...
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't know where she lives!
sound DUT.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Calm down. Getting worked up isn't gonna help anyone!
text I head to the shoe lockers without another word.
text Kyou is right.
text I don't know anything about Kotomi.
text I've been pretending not to notice that fact, masking it with the fun times we've had every day.
text It's a fact that now mortifies me.
